xt","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"represented. Artificial harmonics can add a notated touching pitch; artificial pinch harmonics will usually"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not notate a touching pitch. The attributes for the harmonic element refer to the use of the circular harmonic"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"symbol, typically but not always used with natural harmonics."}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlharmonic","title":"MXLHarmonic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLHarmonic","kind":"symbol"}}}